{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356920/extras/b9cb38a8075319b6454f37829bee7edc.avif?t=1759718636\" data-has-big width=1560 height=213 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a part of a 8 member squad send on a mysterious island to extract and rescue a princess. After been seperated with your squadmates, you're left alone in an island surrounded by mutated zombies and other horrors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356920/extras/8436d8937aa99f5f7b667d7ba9137d70.poster.avif?t=1759718636\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356920/extras/8436d8937aa99f5f7b667d7ba9137d70.webm?t=1759718636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356920/extras/8436d8937aa99f5f7b667d7ba9137d70.mp4?t=1759718636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A voodoo staff found on the island grants you the power to fight back against the monsters that are in the way, between you, your fellow soldiers, and the princess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356920/extras/9b46fcf3d391e5c82468dd763b9c6974.avif?t=1759718636\" data-has-big width=1560 height=213 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356920/extras/027a82facc48b2b7fb0f5dbb240c44d1.poster.avif?t=1759718636\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356920/extras/027a82facc48b2b7fb0f5dbb240c44d1.webm?t=1759718636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356920/extras/027a82facc48b2b7fb0f5dbb240c44d1.mp4?t=1759718636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro FPS gunfights :</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you're a skilled soldier that can weild all kind of  guns that you'll find all around the island. use the guns to kill zombies and all kinds of freaks that blocks your way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >your voodoo staff is your main healing source. use the right timing to heal your wounds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >your voodoo staff also makes your bullets with your soul. Shooting drains your health. Always chech your health and heal with the voodoo staff when needed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >kill foes and collect souls to refill your voodoo staff.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >progress through the story to gain new abilities with the voodoo staff.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >no ammo pickups and no reloading required.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356920/extras/239ca2f648b4117c5c0a5fe229dc6ba1.avif?t=1759718636\" data-has-big width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through\u00a0an island\u00a0 taken over by an evil necromancer, with allies you'll meet along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3356920?t=1759718636","back