 reloading required.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356920/extras/239ca2f648b4117c5c0a5fe229dc6ba1.avif?t=1759718636\" data-has-big width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through\u00a0an island\u00a0 taken over by an evil necromancer, with allies you'll meet along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Laverdure Kevin"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356920/88b7a574f9e576e543febb75b6dbb472eca1a1ca/header.jpg?t=1759718636","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"(c) Kevin Laverdure","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3356920/1786645147/d5f86b0e41feac0df806fa97703ae1a63a255c5f/1759718149/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759718635","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3356920/1786645147/d5f86b0e41feac0df806fa97703ae1a63a255c5f/1759718149/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759718635","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3356920/1786645147/d5f86b0e41feac0df806fa97703ae1a63a255c5f/1759718149/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759718635","id":257211681,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257211681/movie480.mp4?t=1759718635","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257211681/movie